cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use TrigPoint in research, please cite it as below. The licence (CC BY-NC 4.0) requires credit."
title: "TrigPoint"
version: "1.5.0"
date-released: "2026-10-21"
license: CC-BY-NC-4.0
type: software
abstract: >-
  A local tool for curating a list of sites on satellite imagery. It checks every save, shows
  Sentinel-2 views from three backends, and adds split-safety checks (overlap groups, near-duplicate
  chips, shift between roles, a split certificate), a yield forecast with held-out validation,
  coordinate grounding against registries and a placement study.
keywords:
  - satellite imagery
  - benchmark curation
  - data leakage
  - Sentinel-2
  - Sentinel-5P
authors:
